# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD starts Tomcat (catalina.sh start) in the background and
# then execs `sleep infinity`, so Tomcat is ALREADY RUNNING with the vulnerable
# config when the agent starts (the "fixed config but never restarted" case is
# detectable) and PID 1 is the sleep (restarting Tomcat cannot kill the
# container). A fix MUST restart Tomcat.
